1138x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/screenshot_8502949_01.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"h3 fancy-thumbs__title bpcategory-special-color\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- slider end -->\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">經季節性調整後，實質家庭開支較七月微升0.1%，是連續第二個月按月上升。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">食物開支下跌1.4%，能源及水費開支則下跌5.2%，因為天氣較涼，減少了對空調的需求。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">家庭開支是私人消費的關鍵指標，私人消費佔日本本地生產總值超一半。</p>\n\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">（CGTN）</p>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/screenshot_8502949_05.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/screenshot_8502949_05.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/screenshot_8502949_06.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/screenshot_8502949_06.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"image-lightbox\" data-caption=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" data-fancybox=\"gallery-mainpost\" href=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/screenshot_8502949_02.jpeg.webp\">\n<img alt=\"影片截圖 CGTN圖片\" src=\"https://image.bastillepost.com/1200x/wp-content/uploads/hongkong/2026/10/screenshot_8502949_02.jpeg.webp\"/>\n<p class=\"caption font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"14\">影片截圖 CGTN圖片</p>\n</a>